WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.610
<b>Several Hours Ago...</b>

3
00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.700
Thing is, I got beef
with the World Government.

4
00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:25.170
Apparently, they're not just killing Stella,
they're gonna kill me, too!

5
00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:30.630
<b>Emperor Red Hair's Pirate Crew</b>

6
00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:27.710
So rude, am I right?

7
00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.170
Am I right?! Hey!

8
00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.630
Say it's rude!

9
00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.380
Correct. It's very rude.

10
00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.340
You paused!

11
00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:36.340
But anyways, I got a plan
to turn this thing around!

12
00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.760
So

13
00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:43.520
your job is to help mama kill some people
who are annoying her, okay?

14
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.770
I shut the Frontier Dome, so I want

15
00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:51.070
everyone in here dead, except me, Stella,
and the hostages underground. Say "roger" if you got all that.

16
00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.690
[ALL]
– Roger!
– Roger!

17
00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.950
Sweetness. Now, when you start
kicking their butts,

18
00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:59.780
problem is, the Punks'll go, "Wait,
who's ordering these things?"

19
00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:00.870
And then they'll catch me!

20
00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:05.250
I can't beat 'em in a fair fight,
so I need a backup plan!

21
00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.290
Cue S-Snake!

22
00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.210
Yes?

23
00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:11.840
You gotta petrify me.
And do it in front of them, alright?

24
00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:12.550
[S-SNAKE]
Right.

25
00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:15.130
Then come back and undo it
when no one's looking!

26
00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:15.930
Roger.

27
00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:22.140
[YORK]
Oh! Before I forget, there's
a couple places in the lab you shouldn't blow up.

28
00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:24.640
This is important,

29
00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:28.230
so listen real carefully.

30
00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.060
Ready. Steady. Hunt!

31
00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:31.860
punch.

32
00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:55.420
[CITIZEN A]
Everyone on the ship! Quick!

33
00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.300
[CITIZEN B]
We need
to get off Egghead, now!

34
00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:20.740
<b>Warland, Elbaph
New World</b>

35
00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.100
[KID]
Everyone ready?

36
00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.410
Let's get to work.

37
00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.630
[KID PIRATES]
Yeah!

38
00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:34.460
Kid Pirate!

39
00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:39.010
Only a fool would oppose our chief.
You're gonna die today.

40
00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:42.510
I told you!

41
00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.220
[PIRATE A]
No! Not the frog thing!

42
00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.140
Get lost or croak, ribbit!

43
00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.270
<b>Captain "Frog-Toes" Gerotini
Puddle Pirates</b>

44
00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.060
Yeah! What he said!

45
00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.400
[PIRATE B]
Pops, your dentures!

46
00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:55.610
<b>Bandmaster Fuga "the Addenturer"
Social Club</b>

47
00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:57.360
[PURURU]
Away with you, fools!

48
00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:58.780
I do not like you!

49
00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:03.820
You will never reach Chiefy! Go away!

50
00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.580
Now! Or I shall be cross with you!

51
00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.500
[PIRATE N]
You are so brave, Princess.

52
00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.710
<b>Pururu "the Brr-rave"
Bourgeois Pirates</b>

53
00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.270
Is Red Hair mocking us?

54
00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.920
These can't be his real allies.

55
00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.420
How do these clowns even survive
in the New World?

56
00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.590
[KILLER]
I get what you mean,
but he's got a few famous names in there.

57
00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.220
Don't get sloppy.

58
00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:28.060
Whether they're weak
or strong, I'm not here to show mercy.

59
00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.320
[SHANKS]
Are we ready to set sail?

60
00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:37.190
[RED-HAIRED PIRATE D]
Hey, Boss!

61
00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:39.940
The other crews went out to stop Kid!

62
00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.400
[SHANKS]
Then tell them to retreat!

63
00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.490
I don't want them dying for nothing.

64
00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:45.030
[PIRATES]
– Whoa, whoa, whoa!
– Whoa, whoa, whoa!

65
00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.780
– Wait, wait, wait!
– Wait, wait, wait!

66
00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.460
[PIRATES]
– C'mon, Chief! What are you tryin' to pull?
– C'mon, Chief! What are you tryin' to pull?

67
00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.710
[SHANKS]
I think I should be asking you that.

68
00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:57.880
We'll handle this!
They won't lay a damn finger on you!

69
00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:58.920
[BOTH]
– That's right!
– That's right!

70
00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.930
Thanks, guys. For the offer, I mean.

71
00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.430
But seriously, stay put.

72
00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:07.810
here. Just leave me.

73
00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.860
Please don't go!

74
00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:18.020
At least let us fight beside you!

75
00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.160
Whoa, that's enough! Easy!

76
00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.530
Aw, come on!

77
00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.410
Aw, c'mon! You can't be takin' off already!

78
00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.080
Yeah, you just got here!

79
00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.040
We've hardly had a chance to chat!

80
00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.410
[SHANKS]
We got places to be.

81
00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.830
I was just stoppin' here for a quick drink.

82
00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:39.050
I'm sorry, but let me go, guys. C'mon.

83
00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:44.220
[SHANKS]
A big shot showed up
because I bummed around too long.

84
00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.300
[SHANKS]
Alright, one more time.

85
00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.100
Tell the ships to retreat!

86
00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.520
You know I'd take you, but I can't be seen
with a bunch of weaklings.

87
00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.600
[PIRATE I]
Tell us how you really feel!

88
00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.900
[OLI]
What does it matter if we're weak?

89
00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:01.110
We're invincible as long as we have your flag!

90
00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:02.440
[SHANKS]
Don't get too comfortable, Oli.

91
00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:05.530
My flag can't scare off old age for ya.

92
00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:09.410
[OLI]
Ha-ha! Do you hear the way
he talks to me? No respect for his elders!

93
00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:11.910
Hurry up, Boss! Your fans can wait.

94
00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.410
[SHANKS]
Oh, please.

95
00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.500
Eh, we'll wrap this up in two shakes
of a drumstick. Don't worry.

96
00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:19.460
Don't get cocky. Kid's worth three billion, y'know?

97
00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.960
They grow up fast these days.
You gotta be careful.

98
00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:29.720
[SHANKS]
But they had a hell of a fight in Wano.
Does it look like their wounds have healed?

99
00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:30.510
Uh-huh.

100
00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:33.020
They're in tip-top shape.

101
00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:35.140
Definitely ready for a fight.

102
00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.390
That's good to hear.

103
00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.690
What about Blackbeard? Any updates yet?

104
00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:43.650
No. All we know is that he left Pirate Island.

105
00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.610
I was so sure he'd show up
in the Land of Wano.

106
00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:48.910
Hongo!

107
00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.490
Ready. Here's your intel on Kid.

108
00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.450
[RED-HAIRED PIRATE E]
We're so proud
of you, turning your homework in on time.

109
00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.790
That's enough! We got a ship to load!

110
00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.290
[SHANKS]
I see. So he's from the South Blue.

111
00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.420
And it looks like he's gone
on quite the rampage.

112
00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.640
[KID]
How many ships are there?

113
00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.140
[KILLER]
Nine total.

114
00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:15.100
There are some faces
I've seen on wanted posters.

115
00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:36.080
[KID]
I don't care
who we're up against! Let them come!

116
00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:43.670
I'll wipe them all out in ten seconds flat!

117
00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:45.670
Here it comes!

118
00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:54.390
[PIRATE K]
He's pulling
the ship! Do something!

119
00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:55.430
What is that?

120
00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:57.680
A Cannon.

121
00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.980
I'll crush you under my feet!

122
00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:02.440
I'm going straight to the top,

123
00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:06.420
and I won't let anyone get in my way!

124
00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.910
See you in hell!

125
00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.990
Come on.

126
00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.990
C'mon, Red Hair! The next one's for you!

127
00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.810
Damn it.

128
00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.040
Tell the fleet to spread out!

129
00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:00.620
You see somethin', Boss?

130
00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.080
Dorry! Brogy! Get ready!

131
00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.290
[DORRY, BROGGY]
– We were born ready!
– We were born ready!

132
00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.920
[SHANKS]
Hard to port!

133
00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.600
Too much power. He'll kill them!

134
00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.190
I guess he saw a future he didn't like.

135
00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:37.950
See you in hell!

136
00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.790
[SHANKS]
Should've expected this!

137
00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.460
You kept me waiting!

138
00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.140
[SHANKS]
Divine Departure.

139
00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:10.420
[KILLER]
Partner.

140
00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:12.880
[KID]
Yeah.

141
00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.380
[KILLER]
Won't be long now.

142
00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:16.800
[KID]
That's right!

143
00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:22.220
[KID]
Just look at how far we've come.

144
00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.060
Only one Road Poneglyph left to take,

145
00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.350
then we set sail for the One Piece.

146
00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:30.100
You hear that? Kaido, Big Mom, Red Hair?

147
00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:33.070
Ha! All the old-timers couldn't cut it.

148
00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.690
They can't keep up with us.

149
00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:37.530
Our crew's made it to the front of the pack.

150
00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:40.740
I will be King of the Pirates.

151
00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:43.080
No one can stop me.

152
00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.450
Killer, you bastard.

153
00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.660
You laughing at me?

154
00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:14.480
Boss, wake up!

155
00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.810
Open your eyes, please!

156
00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.110
Get up!

157
00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:18.940
[PAPAS]
Damn it!

158
00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.320
Killer got hurt trying to protect him!

159
00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.710
[HEAT]
No! Stop, Red Hair! We surrender!

160
00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:33.710
Please, have mercy!

161
00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:36.420
We're begging you, please don't kill our boss!

162
00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.090
Go, Emma. Bring them out.

163
00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:43.720
Huh? – Hurry!

164
00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:50.100
[HEAT]
These are our Road Poneglyphs!

165
00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.390
All the ones we've got!

166
00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:54.900
You can have them, just please let us live!

167
00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:10.120
C'mon, Chief! Time to go!

168
00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:26.260
Hey, you guys.

169
00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.540
Look over there!

170
00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.480
It's not over.

171
00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.820
Something's coming!

172
00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:53.250
Hey, little ones,

173
00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:56.420
you know what happens when you point
a gun at someone's home, right?

174
00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.460
You better be ready
for them to start shooting back.

175
00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.350
Hakoku!

176
00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:50.690
[NARRATOR]
Thus, the battle
at Elbaph ended. Eustass "Captain" Kid,

177
00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:55.250
with a bounty of three billion berries,
fell alongside his crew, the Kid Pirates.

178
00:15:56.310 --> 00:16:00.650
It was a massacre.

179
00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:14.820
Running so long lost track of just how long its been

180
00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:22.180
Collected scars while striving not even trying beneath my skin

181
00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:29.600
But in the back of my head the dream is not dead I remember a map

182
00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:35.890
to a treasure still gleaming its within our grasp

183
00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:42.800
Can you feel my heart Feelings I impart

184
00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:49.910
The promises are there theyre deep down but still primed to share

185
00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:59.020
Peerless dreams kept close the dreams that always matter most

186
00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:04.770
Before we set sail why not raise a toast

187
00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:11.800
So I pen this note to you Dear sunrise Ill see you soon

188
00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:18.990
See the smile I saw the day that I sang this song to you

189
00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:26.040
And regardless of our age these memries will still remain

190
00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:33.150
Wont forget until this wish makes it to you
